# Storage / cache runtime artifacts are handled by the per-directory placeholder
# `.gitignore` files in storage/ and bootstrap/cache/ (each contains `*` + `!.gitignore`).
# Do NOT re-add blanket `/storage/...` or `/bootstrap/cache/` patterns here: git cannot
# re-include a file inside an ignored directory, so those patterns would untrack the
# placeholders themselves and recreate known issue #4 in AGENTS.md.

